	(text "ERRATA\nI messed up the placements/nets/silk screen on the buttons.\nV3.0, V3.1, V3.2 are:\nSilk screen BUTTON 1, Upper Left, GP14 (net is BTN_2, Ref. Des. B1)\nSilk screen BUTTON 2, Lower Left, GP15 (net is BTN_1, Ref. Des. B2)\nSilk screen BUTTON 3, Lower Right, GP7 (net is BTN_4, Ref. Des. B4)\nSilk screen BUTTON 4, Upper Right, GP6 (net is BTN_3, Ref. Des. B3)\nNext revision will keep physical button positions mapped\nto same GP Inputs and correct net and Ref. Des. labels."
