	(text "REVISION HISTORY\n\nV3.0 (built in July 2026)\n	* Was not distributed. These were all reworked to at least V3.1.\n\nV3.1 (distributed through August 3, 2026)\n    * Buck-Boost output voltage setting corrected to 3.3V by changing R6/R7 from 8.2K/2.2K to 47K/15K.\n    * I2C Pull-ups R13&14 reworked from 2.2K to 4.7K for more reliably I2C operation.\n    * Charging circuit has 2.2K current program resistor, 545 mA. This is a little high for the included\n    LiPo pack. Suggest replacing that resistor with 4.7K for 212mA charge current limit.\n    * May or may not have V3.1 label added to the board on the top of the USB-C connector.\n\nV3.2 (started distribution August 15, 2026)\n    * Reduced LiPo charging current, reworked R3 from 2.2K (454 mA) to 4.7K (212mA)\n    * Add V3.2 label."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 310.388 213.614 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 255 2 6 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "980ec90d-156b-4e21-bd6f-1ca8324320ca")
	)
